 "problems": [
  "The Franco-Thai War page's list of provinces ceded in 1941 did not come through WebFetch for the reviewer either; the Thai 1941-46 region stays at confidence 2.",
  "WebFetch did not find the Philippines keyframe 0 quote ('The Commonwealth ended when the United States recognized Philippine independence on July 4, 1946') on the Philippines page; the fact is on the Treaty of Manila page. Advisory only.",
  "For jk-01: empire-of-japan uses counterpart burma for 1942 Burma (/ledger/63, /ledger/108) although the burma dossier ends in 1885 (british-raj holds Burma in Cliopatria 1940-42 and 1945-46); it has no 1943 hand-over of Kedah, Perlis, Kelantan, Terengganu and Kengtung to Thailand.",
  "For se-04 (other parts): khmer-rouge must start by 1970-72 (kingdom-of-cambodia contests it from 1972 and loses to it in April 1975); east-timor must start by 1975; republic-of-vietnam and communist-laos are counterparts here.",
  "Reviewer applied fixes in place to kingdom-of-thailand, kingdom-of-cambodia, democratic-republic-of-vietnam and kingdom-of-laos; all re-validated with no errors or warnings."
 ]
